l and Spring semesters. If you would like to be included in the email list, please contact CareerServices@husson.edu . Join Us On LinkedIn Explore the unique career paths of Husson Alumni and discover how a Husson education can be the catalyst for incredible journeys. Listen Now Back to Top Husson University | 1 College Circle | Bangor, Maine | 04401-2929 207.941.7000 | admit@husson.edu | Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Instagram Flickr Careers Board of Trustees Safety & Security Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Accessibility Copyright © Husson University, 1997-2026"
