kage. If you would like to join our talented faculty and staff, explore our job listings. Husson University recruits and hires for all positions without regard to race or color, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, physical or mental disability, religion, age, ancestry or national origin, genetic information or other status protected by law. This policy applies to promotions, training, compensation and all other conditions related to employment. The University will make reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals in accordance with applicable law. Back to Top Husson University | 1 College Circle | Bangor, Maine | 04401-2929 207.941.7000 | admit@husson.edu | Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Instagram Flickr Careers Board of Trustees Safety & Security Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Accessibility Copyright © Husson University, 1997-2026"
